    <description>Owner decision 2026-08-31: whenever a Test Drive is created (any channel — auto-created on Explore, or manually), the Opportunity Owner gets a Task + notification + email prompting them to complete the record (vehicle, date/time, location, assigned consultant). Complements AF_FL_TestDrive_NotifyOnAssignment, which separately notifies the assigned consultant once one is set — this flow fires unconditionally on create, that one only on assignment. 2026-09-09: upgraded from plain text to branded HTML (sendRichBody=true). Tried real EmailTemplate + AF_SendTemplateEmailAction (Apex wrapper around Messaging.sendEmail(templateId=...)) first, since Flow&apos;s own &quot;emailTemplate&quot; core action is confirmed NOT a valid InvocableActionType in this org&apos;s Metadata API - but Messaging.sendEmail to a User target hard-requires saveAsActivity=false, and with that forced false, ZERO EmailMessage row is created (confirmed empirically: isSuccess()=true, no EmailMessage ever appears), unlike emailSimple+logEmailOnSend which reliably logs even to User recipients. Reverted to emailSimple/inline-HTML for this reason.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>EmailBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&apos;&lt;html&gt;&lt;body style=&quot;margin:0;padding:16px;background-color:#F4F4F6;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #E2E5EA;border-top:4px solid #8A6D00;padding:20px 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:inline-block;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FCEFC7;color:#8A6D00;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px;&quot;&gt;Action Required&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:18px;color:#0B2545;&quot;&gt;Test Drive Needs Details&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px;color:#4A4A4A;&quot;&gt;A Test Drive record (&lt;strong&gt;&apos; &amp; {!$Record.Name} &amp; &apos;&lt;/strong&gt;) was created on your Opportunity and still needs details completed — vehicle, scheduled date/time, location, and assigned Sales Consultant.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#4A4A4A;&quot;&gt;Please open the record in Salesforce to complete it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;&apos;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>EmailSubject</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Action Required: Complete Test Drive Details – &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>NotifBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Complete the details on Test Drive &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>NotifTitle</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Test Drive Needs Details&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>TaskActivityDate</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISBLANK({!$Record.AF_TestDriveDateTime__c}), TODAY() + 1, DATEVALUE({!$Record.AF_TestDriveDateTime__c}))</expression>
    </formulas>
